{
	"title": "Réduire une expression avec des puissances",
	"description": "Calcul littéral, exposants relatifs : (kxᵃ)² × mxᵇ ; quotient de monômes en x et y",
	"grades": ["2"],
	"theme": "Calcul littéral",
	"domain": "Calculs",
	"subdomain": "Avec des puissances",
	"level": 3,
	"delay": 60,
	"status": "draft",
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Réduis l'expression (${{L}}\\neq0$).\n\n$$\\left({{k}}{{L}}^{ {{a}} }\\right)^2\\times{{m}}{{L}}^{ {{b}} }=?$$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "L",
					"expression": "x|y|t|z"
				},
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "2..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "-3..-1"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["2*(a)+(b) != 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(k)*(k)*(m)}}{{if:2*(a)+(b)==1|{{L}}|{{L}}^{ {{eval:2*(a)+(b)}} }}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On élève au carré, puis on multiplie les nombres entre eux et les puissances de ${{L}}$ entre elles.",
					"$$\\left({{k}}{{L}}^{ {{a}} }\\right)^2\\times{{m}}{{L}}^{ {{b}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:(k)*(k)}}{{L}}^{ {{eval:2*(a)}} }}\\times{{m}}{{L}}^{ {{b}} }={{eval:(k)*(k)}}\\times{{m}}\\times{{L}}^{ {{eval:2*(a)}}+({{b}})}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{{{eval:(k)*(k)*(m)}}{{if:2*(a)+(b)==1|{{L}}|{{L}}^{ {{eval:2*(a)+(b)}} }}}}$$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Simplifie l'expression et écris-la sous la forme d'un quotient, sans exposant négatif ($x\\neq0$, $y\\neq0$).\n\n$$\\dfrac{ {{eval:(c)*(q)}}x^{ {{a}} }y}{ {{q}}xy^{ {{b}} } }=?$$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "2..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "2..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "3..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "3..4"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "\\frac{ {{c}}x^{ {{eval:(a)-1}} } }{y^{ {{eval:(b)-1}} } }"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On simplifie les nombres, puis les puissances de $x$, puis celles de $y$ : $\\dfrac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n}$.",
					"$$\\dfrac{ {{eval:(c)*(q)}}x^{ {{a}} }y}{ {{q}}xy^{ {{b}} } }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\dfrac{ {{eval:(c)*(q)}} }{ {{q}} }}\\times\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{x^{ {{a}}-1}}\\times\\textcolor{{{color:primary.2}}}{y^{1-{{b}} }}={{c}}x^{ {{eval:(a)-1}} }y^{ {{eval:1-(b)}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\dfrac{ {{c}}x^{ {{eval:(a)-1}} } }{y^{ {{eval:(b)-1}} } }}$$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "(2x³)² × 3x⁻¹ = 12x⁵",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"L": "x|x",
				"k": "2",
				"a": "3",
				"m": "3",
				"b": "-1"
			},
			"answers": ["12x^5"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : coefficient non élevé au carré (6x⁵)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"L": "x|x",
				"k": "2",
				"a": "3",
				"m": "3",
				"b": "-1"
			},
			"answers": ["6x^5"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : (x³)² lu x⁵ (12x⁴)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"L": "x|x",
				"k": "2",
				"a": "3",
				"m": "3",
				"b": "-1"
			},
			"answers": ["12x^4"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "6x⁴y / (2xy³) = 3x³/y²",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": {
				"c": "3",
				"q": "2",
				"a": "4",
				"b": "3"
			},
